# Tomodachi Life: Living the Dream [010051F0207B2000] v1.0.4 - 60FPS

// Unlocks the frame rate to 60 FPS.  The engine computes its frame divisor as
// 60 / W20 and stores the result; W20 is 2 by default (30 FPS).  This overwrites
// the instruction right before that divide (LDR W9,[X0,#0x24]) with MOVZ W20,#1,
// forcing the divisor to 1 so the target becomes 60 FPS.

@flag print_values
@flag offset_shift 0x100

// 60 FPS
@enabled
0027f518 34008052   // MOVZ W20,#1  (was LDR W9,[X0,#0x24]) -> frame divisor 1 = 60 FPS
@stop

// 60 FPS mechanism by Fl4sh9174 (https://github.com/Fl4sh9174); ported to 1.0.4
// by re-deriving the site in main.i64 (framerate calc sub_710027F474).
//
// https://github.com/RAMDRAGONS/switch-visuen-mods